{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-12_beg","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-12","title":"風中旗幟","storyCode":"9-14","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eb6995bc57c9fde4692ec4f00c2576c43a8180b6e7a5a1595f04c8ca5a7a57a6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:57 P.M. 天氣/雨\n小丘郡 第十區附近空屋"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到你的心肺受了一定損傷，就連呼吸都將給你帶來劇烈的疼痛，我建議你別費力開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腹部幾乎被撕裂了......傷勢比我預想的還嚴重。是什麼讓你活了下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈......我並非專業醫師，但我也對各個種族的生理結構有些瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同事把你認作瓦伊凡，這不怪他，他太年輕，未曾見過你們祖先盤踞在這片土地上的龐大身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"呃唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少點激動，對你的身體沒好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過你的法術，也做了一些小小的準備，你想在這間屋子裡點火的話，恐怕不太容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情很有趣。發現沒法攻擊我之後，你竟然感到了放鬆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這甚至比你的自衛反應還要自然——也許這才是你內心深處更真實的情緒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來否認已成為你的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被迫成為不想成為的人，你的痛苦顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰在利用你？到處伸手的贊助者，高塔上的陰影，還是渴望複國的遺民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能。一支完全由傀儡率領的隊伍，還不至於能在倫蒂尼姆的監視下這般迅速地崛起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是被推到台前來的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是不是說明，那個提線的人，擁有和你一模一樣的血脈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望我不要說下去？僅僅聽到這個人被提起，你就如此恐懼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，不光是你，整個維多利亞......不，整片大地都該為此感到恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她大概和你一樣年輕，可在這麼短的時間內，她就把那些想要利用她的力量盡數反握在了手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼看，變化會比預料的來得更快啊......我們得早做打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......拉特......蘭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必猜測我的動機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當決定救你時，我並不在乎你的身份。現在我猜到了，我的想法依舊不會變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好不知道我是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你恢復行動能力，離開這個地方，也請永遠不要向任何人提起是誰救了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你在這裡死去，你只需要知道這一點就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"好......謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也別急著道謝。我能做到的只有幫你清創和止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷到你的是感染性最強的活性源石，大量源石顆粒已經順著創口進入了你的血液循環系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你注射了阻斷劑，但恐怕還是無法阻止源石結晶在你的內臟和皮膚上形成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快你會再次在高燒中昏迷，這是好事，至少能減輕急性發作期帶來的由內而外的劇痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能會無意識地咳血，我會儘量把你的頭部墊得高一些，以免你被自己的嘔吐物嗆死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將受到的折磨還遠不止此。以後你無法回到過去的生活中了。礦石病將徹底改變你的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經跟隨你的人會離你而去，甚至轉過身來仇視你、唾棄你。你很難再領導你的戰士，也很難讓你的同胞接納你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這個表情又一次出現。屬於礦石病患者的未來並沒有令你絕望，反而令你感到釋然？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪。炮火再怎麼猛烈突然，也不至於能把一條年輕的紅龍毫無反抗地釘穿在地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你渴望掙脫原本的命運，而少有反抗不需要付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛有一點想錯了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許你不像你的同族那般貪婪好鬥，但你還是保有他們的執著與勇毅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡吧，別再強撐了。我在你旁邊守著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"危......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"......險......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守著你會有危險？昏迷前的一瞬間，你掙扎著想告訴我這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。這周圍過於安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對他們來說，恐怕不是棄卒那麼簡單。看來，計畫得變一變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然冒險，但羅德島也需要你帶去的情報......凱爾希會理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......報告，沒有找到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"廢物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"連個人都看不住，你們這群人有什麼用！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"你們確實看到她受傷倒下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我手下的哨兵親眼看見的，炮彈落下來的時候，領袖還站在上午行刑的地方附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道那*維多利亞方言粗口*是領袖？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"入夥時說的話你都忘了？敵人一來你就光顧著自己跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"太、太快了，我們都沒反應過來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，領袖命令我，她要一個人靜一靜，不許別人靠近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"那我叫你去死你怎麼還不去死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"還*維多利亞方言粗口*說你不是廢物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"收手吧，就算當場打死他也沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要確定的是她是死是活，還有現在人在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒藥學者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓開......我......來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，注意點分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒藥學者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"長、長官！饒了我，嗚......別......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......東西......呃啊！嘔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒藥學者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到......她在哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"倒了！倒了！哈哈哈哈哈！倒了！炸穿了！死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"死......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就是你的分寸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“毒藥學者”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"份量......多了......記一......記......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"真*維多利亞方言粗口*噁心，以後我要離你這個拿人試藥的變態遠一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹我們知道了他沒撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛就在這裡倒下的，而且受了重傷，這傷甚至可能致命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"都受重傷了人還怎麼跑？總不能給炸到地底下去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"我不介意把整條街再炸一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要炸的話，起碼先通知一聲啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"炸街？誰說要炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"別說炸一條街，就算把整座城市都一把火燒乾淨，我們也得把人找出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"正因為我們之中有你這種和維多利亞軍一樣愚蠢的人存在，佔領這座城市的價值才在急遽縮減。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們說怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓領袖知道她在我們眼皮子底下丟了，這後果誰擔得起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖的怒火並非唯一值得畏懼之物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"各位試想一下，在我們許多士兵和合作人士眼中，她即代表了深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"若是任由她脫離我們的掌控，無論得到她的人是敵人還是某個心懷不軌的“朋友”，後果都不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"我*維多利亞方言粗口*想起來，她還......知道我們的全部打算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說，那兩個女人......她們收到這消息了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"會議結束她們就離開了，消息應該還沒傳到她們耳中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉最不喜歡那傢伙，她才不會管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮......我總是搞不清楚她到底有沒有站在我們這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的措辭。我們都站在領袖身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"愛怎麼說怎麼說，你們要對阿赫茉妮下手我管不著，蔓德拉是個好姑娘，你們可別想著把她也一塊坑進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，我的朋友？她亦是我們密不可分的好戰友。與我們一樣，她渴望著在領袖面前彰顯才幹與忠心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道阿赫茉妮和蔓德拉說了什麼，蔓德拉突然變得很聽她的話，整個人都興高采烈的，像是有什麼好事發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“縱火家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_247","isRemote":false,"text":"就是去佔個發報機而已，有什麼好處能比趕緊打下另一座城市來得實在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......領袖至今沒有對我們的計畫表示贊同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們證明自己沒有犯錯，就始終有機會說服她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是說，人我們還是必須要找到囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"即使要翻遍整座城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。那也別磨嘰了，帶人出發啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，去叫醒“囚犯”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我們五個人一起出馬，還不夠把人抓回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了我們的約定，任何功勞都要絕對公平地分配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"......說什麼廢話，你就是連同伴都算計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼不想讓人通風報信，那這些知道這消息的士兵怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"自然是先帶上，畢竟，找到人之前，人手越多越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“強盜”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"等找到以後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都很清楚該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能逃離深池——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒人能窺見深池的秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些繃帶必須處理掉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我已經洗過了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洗了也不能用，這一箱物資被已經被地上的源石污染了，我們沒法保證粉塵能被完全清洗乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，簡，我知道你說的都對，但我們的東西真的不夠用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那頭，又有好幾個受傷嚴重的被抬過來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"您認識他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，我......曾經認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想他們並不想見到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你來安置他們吧，我去診所看看，也許還能找出一點物資。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"簡，快看，有人來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"快點讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，你是來幫我們的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"別擋著礙事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是......羅南？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"一個個搜，哪裡都別放過！聽好了，這附近小巷子多，很容易藏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"羅南，你在幹什麼？是我們啊，你怎麼換了身衣服就不認識你的鄰居和朋友了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......我還有重要任務要做，你再拉著我囉嗦的話，別怪我動手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格受傷了，求你幫幫他吧，看在他一直跟著你做那些事的份上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼傻話？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她背上的傷好重......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有，她的孩子，克雷格......他的頭部也受了不輕的傷。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（需要儘快給他們止血，可是他們並不歡迎我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"都找過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"確定沒有對得上的人藏在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們在找人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不行，這群人亂七八糟地堵在這，要是我們轉身走了，又有人混進來，那就不好交代了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是在找......Outcast去救的人嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那豈不是她會有危險......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我該走了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們，站起來，都給我離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我們這傷患太多了，大家都沒法移動啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"沒法動也得給我動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"來人，把這些礦石病人全部趕出這個街區！小心他們原地炸開，這可比外面那些源石晶簇還要可怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如說，這個滿臉是血的小孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚......啊......媽......媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格，克雷格！不，你不能帶走他，我求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你不光見死不救，還想害死他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"說這麼難聽做什麼？大家都是塔拉人，為了塔拉的大業做點犧牲又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲憤的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"羅南，上次你這麼說，然後我們就失去了西爾莎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......西爾莎？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是這個人......這個人出賣了西爾莎......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（然後他們才把她......把她......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他用西爾莎的命換來了這身衣服......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是她辜負了我們的信任......她活該！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"無法理解領袖偉大和抗爭意義的人，都只配得到這個下場——要是你們再這麼不配合，下面就輪到你們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"志願者青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"簡？你......你不是走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是什麼人？不對啊，我見過你......你不是塔拉人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你別再說下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼人能輕鬆地說出那種話。沒人有資格替別人決定該為什麼犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡拿的什麼東西......是旗幟？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是維多利亞軍人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......維多利亞軍人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不再是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，如果你執意要踐踏這些無辜者的生命，我就是你的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......無辜？你知道這些人都幹了什麼嗎，就說他們無辜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"這個小孩子，還有這裡的每一個人......有誰的手是乾淨的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你利用了你的同胞來換取地位，又反過來欺壓他們......誰來審判你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"別再表演你的大義凜然了，想給誰看呢？快，把她趕走！還有這些和維多利亞逃兵混在一起的感染者，圍起來，他們都該被清理掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"求你，幫幫我，幫幫我們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能再往前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幹什麼？快讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"看你走到哪都拿著這破旗子，你根本不是什麼有能耐的士兵吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論我有多少能耐，我都不會讓你繼續作惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腦子是不是有毛病？他們和你有什麼關係？你就這麼心甘情願地被他們利用？你真這麼愚蠢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚......哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我不會說塔拉語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒能真切地體會過你們平時過的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我也沒得礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩年多以來，我每天走過你們走的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽見過你們的哭，更看過你們的笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心底始終清楚，我們都是一樣的，活生生的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是人，就會犯錯。犯錯的人，該被阻止，該受制裁，該被自己的內心折磨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，決定他們命運的人，不該是一個忘恩負義的惡徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你要保護我們？你不恨我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......說一點都不恨......是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會再裝作......我們之間毫無隔閡。克雷格也確實做錯了事，我無意包庇任何罪惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有人教會了我——眼前的惡，必須被阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這與陣營無關，我本該如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"謝......謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，克雷格，不用緊抓著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論過去我是不是一名合格的戰士，在我決定做逃兵的那一刻起，我都已經做好了戰鬥的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差點忘了，我身上沒什麼東西比這面旗子更乾淨，它的確該有更合適的用處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"簡將撕下來的旗幟一角輕柔地裹上孩子受傷的額頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......對......對不起......姐......姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷格，先別說這些，你好好睡一覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，士兵，你該離開這了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，在離開之前，你需要對西爾莎的事作出交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只有我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲憤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......還有我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I15"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I15"},{"type":"narration","text":"傷勢較輕的人們從各個角落裡站了出來，一個接著一個，聚到了緊握旗幟的簡身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們——你們幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們是要反抗深池嗎？奧布萊恩，你應該跟我一起抓住她，別忘了達米安是怎麼死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲憤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，羅南，我沒忘記達米安，但是......我同樣沒法忘記西爾莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲憤的青年","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是做了很多錯事......我不是瞎子，都到這個時候了，我知道誰才是一直幫我們的那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可她明明不是塔拉人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看見大家的眼神了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少，在這一刻，我們才是站在一起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......一群沒救的傻子！你們會因為這一刻的愚蠢死在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家還是注意傷勢，不用勉強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些惡徒請放心交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這場戰鬥，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我們一定能贏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
